# A size is a positive integer: 3.5 is an xsd:decimal and used to validate.
# expect: ex:F bddo:RangeDatatypeShape sh:NodeConstraintComponent
@prefix ex:    <https://hexplain.io/test/range-invalid#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix sh:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix bddo: <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#> .

ex:F bddo:dataType bddo:bytes ; bddo:size 3.5 .
